  "title": "Build Once, Deploy Everywhere: Introducing the ZeroDev Omni SDK",
  "summary": "Build once, deploy everywhere. Discover the ZeroDev Omni SDK—a high-performance, Zig-based core for native smart accounts in Swift, Go, Rust, and more. The ZeroDev Omni SDK is a cross-platform ERC-4337 smart account SDK built in Zig. It enables developers to implement account abstraction features like gas sponsorship and native mobile signing across Swift, Go, Rust, Kotlin, and Python, ensuring a unified developer experience across web, mobile, and backend.",
